          desc Multi-Raft collapses under its own chatter
    - label Coalesced per node-pair
      children
        - label 10 physical packets per 50 ms
          desc One packet per node pair, all groups inside
        - label 200 packets per second total
          desc Compact bitmap of every group's leader status
        - label Traffic scales with node count
          desc 5,000x fewer packets — Multi-Raft stays viable
